claims:
1. A transport device for transporting perforated objects, comprising:
a gripper head including a permeable suction plate;
suction means connected with said gripper head for providing a pressure drop across said permeable suction plate;
means for adjusting the position of said gripper head;
means for controlling the operation of said suction means and said positioning means, said control means operable to place said gripper head against a perforated object and to actuate said suction means to hold said perforated object against said gripper head; and
means for masking selected portions of said permeable suction plate, said selected portions being selected to align with portions of said perforated object having a relatively large number of perforations.
